    // science — intro
    ['page_slug'=>'science','section_key'=>'intro','sort_order'=>0,'title_en'=>'What the Science stream is for','title_np'=>'विज्ञान स्ट्रिम केका लागि हो','subtitle_en'=>null,'subtitle_np'=>null,'body_en'=>'<p>The <strong>+2 Science</strong> program at Shree Public Secondary School is a two-year higher secondary course (Grades 11 and 12) under the <strong>National Examinations Board (NEB)</strong>. It is one of two NEB streams currently offered at the school — the other being <strong>+2 Management</strong>.</p><p>Students who have completed Grade 10 (SEE) from Shree Public or any other recognised institution may apply to Grade 11 in this stream, subject to eligibility criteria and available seats as confirmed each year by the school office.</p><p>Study extends over two academic years with internal assessments and board examinations as required by NEB.</p>','body_np'=>'<p><strong>+२ विज्ञान</strong> कार्यक्रम श्री पब्लिक माध्यमिक विद्यालयमा <strong>राष्ट्रिय परीक्षा बोर्ड (एनईबी)</strong> अन्तर्गतको दुई वर्षे उच्च माध्यमिक पाठ्यक्रम (कक्षा ११ र १२) हो। यो विद्यालयमा हाल सञ्चालित दुई एनईबी स्ट्रिमहरूमध्ये एक हो — अर्को <strong>+२ व्यवस्थापन</strong> हो।</p><p>श्री पब्लिक वा अन्य मान्यता प्राप्त संस्थाबाट कक्षा १० (एसईई) पूरा गरेका विद्यार्थीहरूले यस स्ट्रिममा कक्षा ११ मा आवेदन दिन सक्छन्।</p><p>अध्ययन दुई शैक्षिक वर्षसम्म चल्छ र एनईबीको आवश्यकता अनुसार आन्तरिक मूल्याङ्कन र बोर्ड परीक्षाहरू हुन्छन्।</p>','image_url'=>null,'icon'=>null,'link_url'=>null,'is_active'=>1],
